*Method 2**\n\nAlternatively, we can actually carry out the process of adding the complex number and its conjugate.\n\nTo obtain the conjugate of the complex number $z=3-4\\text{i},$ we flip the sign of the imaginary part and get $\\overset{―}{z}=3+4\\text{i}.$\n\nAdding, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z+\\overset{―}{z} & =(3-4\\text{i})+(3+4\\text{i}) \\\\  & =(3+3)+\\text{i}(-4+4) \\\\  & =6+\\text{i}0 \\\\  & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533991 true] [17592186275816 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275817 13194139533991 true] [17592186275816 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275818 13194139533991 true] [17592186275816 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275819 13194139533991 true] [17592186275816 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275820 13194139533991 true] [17592186275816 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275821 13194139533991 true] [17592186275816 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533991 true] [17592186275816 1041 "selection" 13194139533991 true] [17592186275816 1104 #edb/ref 17592186275820 13194139533991 true] [17592186275816 1110 #uuid "75b058af-2aa6-54b2-a5a4-88f1a395675b" 13194139533991 true] [17592186275817 1034 "8\\text{i}" 13194139533991 true] [17592186275817 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533991 true] [17592186275817 1111 #uuid "6a820a3f-3505-55d1-8534-7cd8aef057c3" 13194139533991 true] [17592186275818 1034 "12" 13194139533991 true] [17592186275818 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533991 true] [17592186275818 1111 #uuid "20b87d01-5850-54fb-a0c0-3f41691aa9cb" 13194139533991 true] [17592186275819 1034 "7" 13194139533991 true] [17592186275819 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533991 true] [17592186275819 1111 #uuid "8f371e79-9272-5875-a7a5-dd41780164c7" 13194139533991 true] [17592186275820 1034 "6" 13194139533991 true] [17592186275820 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533991 true] [17592186275820 1111 #uuid "7115dfcd-b19a-5b49-9f09-a18780f7520d" 13194139533991 true] [17592186275821 1034 "6-8\\text{i}" 13194139533991 true] [17592186275821 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533991 true] [17592186